      <title>ChatGPT广告200天破10亿美元年化营收 OpenAI打开第三条变现曲线</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260831/ChatGPT%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A200%E5%A4%A9%E7%A0%B410%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E5%B9%B4%E5%8C%96%E8%90%A5%E6%94%B6-OpenAI%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%9D%A1%E5%8F%98%E7%8E%B0%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF/</link>
